  "notes": [
   "The manual pictures are small; pairs of connected pieces were inferred from the steps and ports are left null because exact stud positions could not be read reliably.",
   "Step 1-3 piece identity is ambiguous: I took step 1 as black plate 2x6 plus yellow 1x2 plate, step 2 as black 2x4 brick, step 3 as yellow 2x4 plate and the yellow 4x4 inverted slope.",
   "Plate 1x4 (b18) placement is a best guess on top of the 1x4 bricks; the 2x3 plate (b23) carries the two red round plates in step 11.",
   "The two Plate Special 2x2 with wheel holders (step 8) are on the underside of the base plate; each wheel pin holder is modelled as axle-hole.1/.2 with the wheel pin-hole as a revolute join; tyres are fitted on wheels."
  ]
